	(text "HARNESS J1: every field wire enters on one Molex Micro-Fit 3.0 plug (Teltonika-style harness).\nJ1 = 2x7 right-angle header 43045-1400 (LCSC C277677), 3.00 mm pitch, assembled by JLCPCB.\nCable side, orderable from LCSC with the board order: receptacle 43025-1400 (C293526)\n+ 14 female crimp terminals 43030-0007 (C293530) for 20-24 AWG wire.\nCrimp with a Micro-Fit / MX3.0 ratchet crimper (e.g. Molex 63819-0000). MX3.0-compatible housings and terminals also mate."
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "479547cb-1d8e-414a-881a-55a1b90f6c95")
	)
